1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:07,600
BBNaija Season 11 — free fan polls in, win probabilities out.
No paid services. No X/Twitter API. Runs on a laptop.

2
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:14,400
Every week the engine reads free fan polls. The bbnaijadaily vote widget
is the primary full-share source — graded A.

3
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:20,800
Hand-logged Facebook polls are graded B. ngnews247 video titles and
official bottom-N reports contribute ordering only, never shares.

4
00:00:21,200 --> 00:00:26,000
Missing weeks are never invented. A gap is a no-op,
flagged in the run record.

5
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:29,800
Names resolve against config/housemates.json —
aliases are quarantined, never dropped.

6
00:00:30,300 --> 00:00:34,200
Each observation is weighted by source grade,
capped sample size, and recency decay.

7
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:37,800
λ = 0.6 per week: last week's poll counts more
than the week before it.

8
00:00:38,300 --> 00:00:42,200
Every row is renormalised to sum to one, then combined
into a single weighted share.

9
00:00:42,200 --> 00:00:45,800
That share is the published win probability.
There is no hidden model stacked on top.

10
00:00:46,300 --> 00:00:50,200
Ordering constraints soften on conflict, and every
adjustment is logged with before/after shares.

11
00:00:50,200 --> 00:00:53,800
1,000 bootstrap replicates give the 89% interval. Rank chips
and the podium read from the same draws.

12
00:00:54,300 --> 00:00:58,200
Now the live board. The engine's call to win is Sheba —
25% share, P(#1) of 94%.

13
00:00:58,200 --> 00:01:01,800
Podium: Sheba, Temi Nkem, Ricky. Runner-up cards show P(top-3),
not the same number three times.

14
00:01:02,300 --> 00:01:06,200
The trajectory chart plots aggregated share per week,
with 89% bootstrap bands.

15
00:01:06,200 --> 00:01:09,800
Hover any point for the exact share and its interval.

16
00:01:10,300 --> 00:01:14,200
This is the new week control — the x-axis stops at week 10.
There is no week 11.

17
00:01:14,200 --> 00:01:17,800
Step back to week 9 and every line, marker and tooltip
re-scopes to that week.

18
00:01:18,300 --> 00:01:21,200
Rank probabilities for every active housemate — P(#1), P(top-3),
P(top-5) — plus week-over-week momentum.

19
00:01:21,200 --> 00:01:24,800
Head-to-head compares any two: the win-probability
difference and the likely winner.

20
00:01:25,300 --> 00:01:29,600
Code, data and methodology are all public.
Fan forecast — not an official result.
